      "en": "So Jacob came to Luz (that is, Bethel), which is in the land of Canaan, he and all the people who were with him.",
      "ko": "야곱과 그와 함께한 모든 사람이 가나안 땅 루스 곧 벧엘에 이르고",
      "source_text_hash": "464383e012ac0aa6a87dcf80e3d78c7383eae8aea1cdc361c46e9c213f7184b9",
      "translation_text_hash": "2ceb22e2a4c6a9cf62e44a0a1ea2c983ad14abb5a6603465153c6d7c3d234b95",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "야곱과 그와 함께한 모든 사람이 가나안 땅 루스 곧 벧엘에 이르고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2ceb22e2a4c6a9cf62e44a0a1ea2c983ad14abb5a6603465153c6d7c3d234b95"
      ]
