        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 35,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "Deborah, Rebekah’s nurse, died, and she was buried below Bethel under the oak; and its name was called Allon Bacuth.",
      "ko": "리브가의 유모 드보라가 죽으매 그를 벧엘 아래 상수리나무 밑에 장사하고 그 나무 이름을 알론바굿이라 불렀더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b7fe9f0a2eb4dd07fc334886dbc7f7400626aa30826aa6eaebe470807a4a8e7d",
      "translation_text_hash": "be72ad322a055bec99c16edb15d6012bca4cf5470fcaf10f4bc157f4d9f61045",
