      "en": "God appeared to Jacob again, when he came from Paddan Aram, and blessed him.",
      "ko": "야곱이 밧단아람에서 돌아오매 하나님이 다시 야곱에게 나타나사 그에게 복을 주시고",
      "source_text_hash": "507987689061f78496958eb0d3d6929efc35e649380faf7680c48da516b7ffda",
      "translation_text_hash": "43b525622a5e0107935a061cfdf50be73c89543a9e508e2efcd73b785ceb5be8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
